flowchart TD
  A[Ready issue record] --> B[Operator adoption request]
  B --> C{Typed bind owner verifies}
  C -->|stale or unsafe| X[Fail closed with diagnostics]
  C -->|exact issue branch/worktree| D[Record adoption evidence]
  D --> E[Advance only to bound]
  E --> F[Ordinary implementation finalization]
  F --> G[Exact-head review]
  G --> H[Typed publication]

  C --> C1[Issue/repo/generation/digest]
  C --> C2[Branch not main and issue-owned]
  C --> C3[FastWork worktree topology]
  C --> C4[Exact HEAD and base ancestry]
  C --> C5[No collisions or existing binding]
